	'rs_intro'           => 'We welcome twelve guests at a time along our walnut counter across three seatings each evening. Reservations open fourteen days in advance at noon.',
	'rs_s0h'             => 'Three Evening Seatings',
	'rs_s0b'             => 'We structure our evenings into three distinct seatings: 19:00 to 21:00, 21:00 to 23:00, and 23:00 to 01:00. The early seating at 19:00 offers a quiet counter, suited for an unhurried start to the evening. At 21:00, the room reaches its natural rhythm, with both bartenders in steady motion and the counter at its fullest energy. The late seating at 23:00 runs until our closing hour of 01:00, with last orders taken at 00:30. Across all twelve seats—numbers one through eight facing the working bar and nine through twelve at the window end—the service remains attentive and paced. Guests are asked to arrive promptly so each seating can begin together.',
	'rs_s1h'             => 'How do reservations and deposits work?',
