	'tl_s1h'             => 'What is The Short List?',
	'tl_s1b'             => 'For guests who prefer to place their evening in our hands, we offer The Short List for €42. This tasting progression presents four half-size drinks chosen directly by the bartender on service to reflect your preferences and the balance of the night. Rather than full servings that might rush the palate, these smaller pours allow you to explore different spirits, techniques, and temperatures across the two hours of your seating. It is an unhurried dialogue between the guest and the bartender across the walnut counter.',
	'tl_s2h'             => 'How do you approach zero-proof drinks?',
